# Ignore file for this Dockerfile, per ADR-0400. BuildKit uses <Dockerfile>.dockerignore before the repo-root .dockerignore.
# The root file is for the Go service images and excludes apps/, libs/ts, and package.json, which the frontend build needs.
# This file excludes only VCS, dep, and build-output dirs and the unrelated admin app, so the context is correct for `bun run build`.
**/.git
**/.DS_Store
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
apps/admin
